              "offset_unit": "UTF-16",
              "end_exclusive": true
            },
            {
              "field": "factors.3.interpretation",
              "start": 1310,
              "end": 1340,
              "text": "若把项目当成需要持续对外维护、要承受访问或规则压力的正式产品",
              "offset_unit": "UTF-16",
              "end_exclusive": true
            },
            {
              "field": "factors.3.interpretation",
              "start": 1358,
              "end": 1383,
              "text": "如果仅限自己和熟人小范围娱乐，这种压力不必被放大。",
              "offset_unit": "UTF-16",
              "end_exclusive": true
            },
            {
              "field": "uncertainties.1",
              "start": 1657,
              "end": 1667,
              "text": "因此未确定唯一用神。",
              "offset_unit": "UTF-16",
              "end_exclusive": true
            }
          ],
